    <string name="coach_bienvenida">Hi! I\'m your RutaCima coach. I know your goals, your axes and your progress. Tell me what you want to achieve or where you feel stuck, and I\'ll help you take the next step.</string>
    <string name="coach_local_motivacion">Motivation comes and goes; systems stay. Today you don\'t need to feel like it, you need a 2-minute step. Pick the smallest action from your goal for the month and do it now. Then check it off in Today: seeing your progress lights the fire again.</string>
    <string name="coach_local_rendirse">Before you give up, open the Anti-quitting bonus: most of the time you don\'t need to leave the mountain, just change the route. Ask yourself: does this goal still bring me closer to my summit? If the answer is yes, make the step smaller, not the goal.</string>
    <string name="coach_local_perdido">Getting lost in the fog is part of the journey. Open the Emergency Kit and choose the protocol that describes how you feel. Then come back to your summit in one sentence and decide only the next step.</string>
    <string name="coach_local_meta">A powerful goal is observable. For example: “%1$s”. You\'ll know you achieved it when: %2$s. Suggested deadline: %3$s. Create it in Goals → New goal and connect it to your 5-year purpose.</string>
    <string name="coach_local_sin_eval">To guide you better, rate your 6 axes (Profile → Axes). With that I\'ll know which part of your mountain needs the most attention.</string>
    <string name="coach_local_eje">Your weakest axis today is %1$s. Three actions to strengthen it this week:\n%2$s</string>
    <string name="hablar_coach">Talk to the coach</string>
